<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Thomas &amp; Betts started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Thomas &amp; Betts started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of Thomas &amp; Betts Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimated 1996 earnings at $2.40 per share, 1997 at $2.75.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month target at 49.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 38-3/4 at midday in stock exchange activity.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
